OL,3,GNEWSAAbandoned historical manor to be
OL,4,Aturned into homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn historical former manor house in
OL,7,FKent is to be converted into 30 new
OL,8,Fhomes after being abandoned for years.
OL,10,FHall Place, which sits besides the
OL,11,FA2050 in Harbledown, was built in 1596
OL,12,Fand was most recently used for teaching
OL,13,Fby Canterbury Christ Church University
OL,14,Funtil being left to decay in 2019.
OL,16,FBut, in April last year plans were
OL,17,Fsubmitted to Canterbury City Council
OL,18,F(CCC) to convert it into apartments, an
OL,19,Fapplication which has this week been
OL,20,Fapproved.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
